# Served by Workers static assets. Verified 2026-09-14 against Cloudflare's docs:
# _headers is honored for asset responses, and the www -> apex redirect cannot live
# here — _redirects does not support domain-level (source hostname) matching, so it
# is a zone-level Redirect Rule instead.
# NotifyForm posts to Kit, and the CSP has to permit BOTH of its paths or the form
# silently cannot submit at all:
#
#   connect-src https://app.kit.com   the JavaScript path. Without it the fetch is
#                                     refused by the browser before it leaves, the
#                                     promise rejects, and the form's catch branch
#                                     reports "Couldn't reach the mailing list" —
#                                     which reads like Kit is down rather than like
#                                     a policy on our own page.
#   form-action https://app.kit.com   the no-JavaScript fallback, which is a native
#                                     POST to the same origin. This was 'none',
#                                     which blocks every form on the site.
#
# Media (video loops, posters) is served from R2 at media.uzume.io, so BOTH of
# these are required or the gallery renders nothing:
#
#   media-src https://media.uzume.io   <video>/<source>. There was no media-src
#                                      directive at all, so this fell through to
#                                      default-src 'self' and every clip was
#                                      refused.
#   img-src   https://media.uzume.io   posters and stills, same reason.
#
# Same class of bug as the Kit one below, and it fails the same silent way.
#
# Both were blocked from W.2 until 2026-09-15, and it went unnoticed because Kit's
# endpoint tests clean from curl — CSP exists only in the browser. Test the form in
# a real browser after touching this file, not with a request tool.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://app.kit.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://media.uzume.io; media-src 'self' https://media.uzume.io; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action https://app.kit.com; frame-ancestors 'none'
